From 48ebe1beafd2ae95883920ae658e0a9f550a6dd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 06:22:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 201/211] drm/imagination: Mark BXM-4-64 MC1 36.56.104.183 as
 supported

This is the core in the Allwinner A733. It runs the firmware Imagination
publishes for it and has been driving displays and compute for days on the
Radxa Cubie A7A, so stop demanding exp_hw_support for it.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c
index 54fe4180c73..05c2c81521d 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c
@@ -533,6 +533,7 @@ pvr_gpu_support_level(const struct pvr_gpu_id *gpu_id)
 	case PVR_PACKED_BVNC(33, 15, 11, 3):
 	case PVR_PACKED_BVNC(36, 52, 104, 182):
 	case PVR_PACKED_BVNC(36, 53, 104, 796):
+	case PVR_PACKED_BVNC(36, 56, 104, 183):
 		return PVR_GPU_SUPPORTED;
 
 	default:
-- 
2.30.2

